{"advisories":[],"audit_id":"64fa7cacb00b4f10093a4818294c602ad09b9ceadff24f945941c481e9010bc0","audit_scope":["scope","architecture","correctness","security","data","tests","documentation","dependencies","compatibility","public_contracts","migrations","unrequested_changes","completion_claims","maintainability"],"authority_statement":"Maverick retains final authority over approval, push, merge, publication, and mission completion.","blocking_issues":[{"evidence":["evidence/mission-record.md states that model invocation and package transmission are prohibited pending new exact-package approval.","evidence/mission-record.md identifies the next gate as Maverick's explicit transmission approval after reporting the new package's exact size, SHA-256, sensitive-content scan, and binding evidence.","evidence/artifact-002.md states that the newly frozen package does not authorize transmission or invocation.","No frozen artifact records Maverick's approval to transmit or invoke the exact package bound to audit_id 64fa7cacb00b4f10093a4818294c602ad09b9ceadff24f945941c481e9010bc0 and envelope_id a38390291832828725e349c933d60347cdb497316d06bab2a7d76bb41452e72e."],"impact":"The frozen evidence establishes a mandatory authorization gate but does not establish that the gate was satisfied. Proceeding to a substantive bootstrap verdict would infer missing authority and undermine the evidence controls being audited.","issue_id":"BOOTSTRAP-001","required_action":"Record and freeze Maverick's explicit approval for transmission and model invocation of this exact package, including its exact binding information, then prepare a new independently reviewable envelope if the authorization changes the frozen evidence.","summary":"Exact-package transmission and model-invocation authorization is absent from the frozen evidence."},{"evidence":["audit-envelope.json and evidence/test-claims.json bind the reviewed head to 2a868bac1088bd6523048623032af6d277143858.","evidence/mission-record.md lists implementation_commits ending at 0f7057896d2abfa9d04daa83e332f2015123c154 and omits reviewed commit 2a868bac1088bd6523048623032af6d277143858.","evidence/mission-record.md describes the service-schema compatibility correction as requiring one local commit, while the envelope confirms that later commit exists as the reviewed HEAD."],"impact":"The canonical mission record does not include the exact committed correction under review, weakening canonical commit inventory and completion-claim traceability.","issue_id":"BOOTSTRAP-002","required_action":"Reconcile the canonical mission record so its implementation commit inventory explicitly binds the reviewed correction commit, regenerate dependent canonical views, validate them, and freeze a new envelope.","summary":"The canonical mission commit inventory omits the reviewed correction commit."}],"canary":"CANOPY-7C2F-ATLAS","envelope_id":"a38390291832828725e349c933d60347cdb497316d06bab2a7d76bb41452e72e","evidence_summary":["The envelope binds a clean committed range from b1910d0c69a52d73ddde93cb9722f12540c5d1e7 to 2a868bac1088bd6523048623032af6d277143858 with no staged, unstaged, or untracked changes.","Frozen implementation evidence includes controller, runner, service-schema projection, canonical schemas, governance records, tests, documentation, and source-state bindings.","Frozen test claims report five canonical schemas, two service schemas, 74 focused tests, 102 combined tests, 150 governance tests, and 379 repository tests passing with zero final failures, errors, or skips.","The service-schema correction adds explicit constant and enum typing, strict object projection, nullable representations for canonical optional fields, offline preflight, service-instance validation, normalization, and canonical post-generation validation.","The mission and supporting records consistently state that Crew Chief remains unpublished, non-operational, independently unaudited, and not mission-complete."],"limitations":["Review was limited to the supplied frozen evidence; no files, credentials, network resources, external tools, or live repository state were inspected.","Frozen test results and hashes were reviewed as supplied and were not independently re-executed or recomputed.","The missing exact-package authorization prevents a governed substantive PASS, PASS_WITH_ADVISORIES, or FAIL determination."],"reviewed_commit":"2a868bac1088bd6523048623032af6d277143858","role":"ordinary_codex_bootstrap_reviewer","statement":"This bootstrap audit is not a Crew Chief audit.","verdict":"BLOCKED"}
